---
import ContentLayout from "../layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
---

<ContentLayout
	title="About Us"
	description="Learn about Glass Graphics - your wholesale supplier of corporate and specialty gifts and awards since 1981."
>
	<p class="lead">
		Thank you for considering Glass Graphics to be your supplier of
		corporate and specialty gifts and awards. We specialize in custom
		engraved crystal, wood, marble, nickel and silver products.
	</p>

	<p>
		Since we first opened for business in 1981, our focus has always been on
		providing our customers with the finest engraving on the finest
		products, the best service, and the most competitive pricing. Large or
		small, this is the promise that we make to each of our customers.
	</p>

	<p>
		Since we are a wholesale only dealer, some of the benefits to our
		customers include:
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li>No logo set-up fees</li>
		<li>No minimums</li>
		<li>Fast & friendly service</li>
		<li>Supplier of blank goods</li>
		<li>Reliable vendor for over 42 years</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		For ordering information, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
	</p>

	<div class="card">
		<h2 class="team-heading">Thank you for visiting us</h2>
		<div class="team-members">
			<div class="team-member">
				<strong>Stu Dunlop</strong>
				<span>President/Co-Owner</span>
			</div>
			<div class="team-member">
				<strong>Andrew Peterson</strong>
				<span>Vice President/Co-Owner & Retail Sales Manager</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</ContentLayout>

<style>
	.lead {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.team-heading {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.team-members {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.team-member {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		text-align: center;
		gap: 0.25rem;
	}

	.team-member strong {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--gg-text);
	}

	.team-member span {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--gg-muted);
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.team-members {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
